Hello, you probably looked at this folder thinking "what do they mean by UltraTextures?"

Put simply, it's a combination of other textures compiled into one big fuck off texture.
This is the engine can call to one texture instead of hundreds of smaller textures.

Also to save my sanity during the pipeline process.


Q: "Isn't this just a MegaTexture?"
A: No, that is a virtual texture from the Einstein of game programming; John Carmack.
Plus, UltraTextures sounds badass.

Q: "Why don't you use texture altas/sheets/etc?"
A: I do, and funnily enough, it inspired UltraTextures. Moreso Texture Atlases.

Q: "Are we not men?"
A: We are devo.

